window.products.push({"id":565278,"name":"shop4ever® My Cat & I Talk About You Engraved Stemless Wine Glass Funny Cat Mom Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FpUICHQfS._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM STEMLESS WINE GLASS. Designed and permanently laser engraved in-house for the highest quality crystal-clear finish. Features a stemless, sturdy base design to minimize the risk of breakage. Ergonomic shape showcasing a narrow rim and sleek silhouette for an easy, comfortable grip. PERFECT 15 oz. CAPACITY. Holds 15 ounces of any delicious wine, cocktail, beer, water, juice, soda, whatever your heart desires! The wine glass is versatile and can not only be used for beverages but also yogurt parfaits, candle holder, and more. GIFT BOX READY. Thoughtful, funny wine glass gift to surprise a cat lover with. Wine glass for cat mom, cat mama, cat dad, crazy cat lady, cat person, women, men, mom, dad, adult, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, bestfriend, coworker, boss, wife, husband, boyfriend, girlfriend, employee, roommates, students, cousin, in laws, aunt, uncle, him, her, family, nurse, and the lists goes on. AFFORDABLE NOVELTY PRESENT. Perfect gift idea for Christmas, Birthday, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Anniversary, Retirement, Housewarming, Graduation, Valentines, or any other special occasion that you want to show appreciation for. CAREFULLY PACKED WITH LOVE. All of our wine glasses are all individually inspected to make sure they are perfect and up to our high standards. The glasses are also hand packed and bubble wrapped for extra security through any delivery. We strive for excellence and expect nothing but the best for our customers! Please feel free to reach out to the Shop4ever Family with any inquiries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FpUICHQfS._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"shop4ever","source_asin":"B08S6B1PJK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-565278","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S6B1PJK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S6B1PJK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":565279,"name":"316 Medical Stainless Steel Food Containers - 4800ml Total Capacity Set of 3 Sizes Kimchi Storage Lunch Box with Sealed Lid - Freezer & Dishwasher Saf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aDnWM+oSL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Best Stainless Steel By Tye 316 Type 316 exhibit better corrosion resistance and is stronger at elevated temperatures. It also non-hardenable by heat treatment and can be readily formed and drawn (pulled or pushed through a die or smaller hole). Annealing (a treatment to reduce hardness and increase ductility, or the ability to accept plastic deformation) 316 stainless steel requires heat treatment of between 1,900 and 2,100 degrees Fahrenheit (1,038 to 1,149 degrees Celsius) before rapidly quenching. Qualities of Type 316 Steel Type 316 steel is an austenitic chromium-nickel stainless steel that contains between two and 3% molybdenum. The molybdenum content increases corrosion resistance, improves resistance to pitting in chloride ion solutions, and increases strength at high temperatures. Type 316 grade stainless steel is particularly effective in acidic environments. This grade of steel is effective in protecting against corrosion caused by sulfuric, hydrochloric, acetic, formic, and tartaric acids, as well as acid sulfates and alkaline chlorides. Properties of type 316 Stainless Steel Density: 0.799g/cubic centimeter Electrical resistivity: 74 microhm-centimeters (20 degrees Celsius) Specific Heat: 0.50 kiloJoules/kilogram-Kelvin (0–100 degrees Celsius) Thermal conductivity: 16.2 Watts/meter-Kelvin (100 degrees Celsius) Modulus of Elasticity (MPa): 193 x 103 in tension Versatile Stainless Steel Box It can be used simply as a food container or as a lunch box. Three different sizes, the big one is often used to store food, and the small one is the lunch box can take to school or work. It is a perfect food storage container. Whether fruit, nuts, sandwiches, bread, vegetables, cereals, waffles, apple pie, pineapple pie, meatloaf, it all fit. Take it out for a picnic, camping, hiking, climbing, or simply have a meal with family in the garden backyard.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aDnWM+oSL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eglaf","source_asin":"B087TPH1R6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-565279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087TPH1R6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087TPH1R6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
