window.products.push({"id":565309,"name":"Fly Joys Heat Resistant Silicone Spatula/Spoonula Non-Stick Wok Turner in Hygienic Solid Coating with Stainless Steel Handle Cookware Kitchen Tools(Re","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EN839hujL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Size:Large A perfect tool when cooking with non-stick cookware and bakeware! Combining the strength of stainless steel with the advantages of silicone, Unicook’s offset spatulas are heat resistant to 600°F and safe for use with all cookware and bakeware, including pans with nonstick finishes. This durable ergonomic spatulas have soft, comfortable, nonslip grips for easy turning and maneuverability. Everyone equates quality and innovative design functionality with Fly Joys products and for good reason. This silicone spatula is no different. May you purchased this one because you were so tired of the nylon plastic spatulas. The edges melt if you use them in a pan that's too hot and then you can't flip an egg. The great thing about silicone is that it can handle the heat.This baby belongs in the kitchen and the more you use it, the more you'll appreciate it's simplistic design and functionality. The silicone can be dropped into boiling oil and never flinch. It's flexible, which is great when trying to get under something you're cooking. Plus, the edge is tapered, so it's easy to get under a fried egg or a pancake, but is reinforced with a piece of steel inside the silicone, so it can also dish it out. Literally. I know it won't last forever, but it's sure making a run for it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EN839hujL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fly Joys","source_asin":"B07CNJP92T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-565309","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CNJP92T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CNJP92T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
