window.products.push({"id":565438,"name":"MCKJHOME 53mm Premium Calibrated Espresso Tamper, 30lb Coffee Tamper with Spring Loaded flat 304 Stainless Steel Base, Professional Barista Espresso H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V4eoUS+kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why MCKJHOME Spring-loaded Tamper? For perfectionists we demand the best possible tasting espresso shot. It is always a challenge when comes to coffee tamping. Our calibrated tamper with 2 interacting constant force springs and a stopper. Allows the pressed powder to remain at the same level each time. This is essential for making espresso because it ensures that the entire dose of grounds is evenly saturated with water, which allows for the optimal extraction of the flavors and aromas. Unique Design: MCKJHOME coffee tamper consists of a 304 stainless steel base and an ergonomic handle with a comfortable grip and premium texture. It is highly polished and easy to clean. It allows you to push the coffee grounds easily and is suitable for both professional baristas and novice home baristas. Consistent Pressure : Once you try making your own espresso, you'll love homemade coffee. This calibrated tamper offers an optimal mashing power of 30 pounds, which will give you consistent distribution and pressure every time, avoiding deviations in the making process and achieving an even extraction of coffee. With this tamper, you can enjoy a flavorful and full-bodied espresso every time. Using tips:Rotate the tamper around the edges of the portafilter as you tamp to get a more even distribution. If the grounds feel too compact, tap the tamper lightly against the counter to loosen them up to obtain the most uniform and firm coffee powder. It will be the perfect accessory for your espresso. More Sizing Options： To ensure the best experience, we recommend that you measure your coffee filter by following our tamper sizing guide to size your tamper perfectly. we offer a variety of sizes such as 51mm, 53mm, 58.35mm tamper compatible with various sizes of flat bottomless portafilter. Please Use a tamper that has the same diameter as your portafilter basket for a better seal. If you decide you are not completely satisfied with your purchase, just contact us and we will refund the money.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V4eoUS+kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MCKJHOME","source_asin":"B0BPWPLDDQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-565438","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPWPLDDQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPWPLDDQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
