window.products.push({"id":565506,"name":"HAPPYGRILL 6FT Christmas Tree Premium PVC Needles, 600 Branch Tips Pre-Lit Flocked Snow Hinged Pine Tree with Solid Metal Stand 250 LED Lights Ideal f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZjSq6luyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Selected PVC with Snow Flocked Design】 This lush Christmas tree is made of environmental-friendly and non-flammable PVC material, which is harmless and safe to use. Besides, the leaves with realistic flocked snow create a unique winter feeling, making the whole tree leafier and fluffier. 【Pre-lit LED Lights】 This Christmas tree is equipped with 250 LED lights with warm white color, which is energy-efficient and long lasting. And UL certified adapter is safe to use. Glowing warmly from our centerpiece tree's branches can provide the perfect brightness, creating a soft and calm mood for the room. 【Easy to Assemble with Hinged Design】 In a few simple steps, this Christmas tree with 3 sections is easy to assemble, disassemble and store. And the hinged branches will expand easier to save your time and energy. Just arrange it a little, hang the decorations, and a beautiful Christmas tree is finished. 【Dense Branches for Versatility】 With 600 branch tips and snow flocked leaves, this full-bodied Christmas tree is like a real tree covered with snow. The 6 ft stereoscopic tree is an attractive addition to blend perfectly with the winter scenery. It is ideal for home, shops, schools, etc. 【Sturdy Metal Stand】 Compared with other cheap plastic base, our reinforced metal stand will provide the tree with greater support and ensure good stability. Foldable X-shaped stand can keep the tree standing upright and prevent the tree from falling. And non-slip foot pads can protect the floor from scratches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZjSq6luyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAPPYGRILL","source_asin":"B08K2ZM5QD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-565506","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K2ZM5QD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K2ZM5QD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":565507,"name":"BeFun #7 - Gelatin Art Tools–Jello Shots -3D Jelly Cake- Set 10 pcs for Beginners and Professionals with Serial Number & 2 Syringes (Set 7)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TddFUsmzL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"BeFun is the finest Precision 3D Gelatin Art Tool Set made. Each of BeFun gelatin art tool feature their own design with amazingly beautiful shape of leaves and flowers. Now you can create detailed 3D flower petals from different angles. This is the method that is traditionally used to make extremely realistic 3D flowers and more.  Hours of Fun 3D Multi Pattern Edible Flowers, Every Tool You Need to Impress Friends & Family on Birthday, Weeding & Christmas, Anniversaries, Holidays or just for everyday enjoyment. Take your 3D Gelatin Art to work and listen as everyone there is amazed. Care Instruction : Before first and after using, wash tool with dish liquid and warm water. Rinse and allow to dry. Should not put tool wet on other metal. Should not leave tool in direct fire. Keep out of the reach of children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TddFUsmzL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BeFun","source_asin":"B01M9HB8AY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-565507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M9HB8AY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M9HB8AY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
