window.products.push({"id":565913,"name":"Super Z Outlet 1 Pound Mixed Bag of Assorted Multi-Color Water Gel Pearls Beads for Home Decoration, Wedding Centerpiece, Vase Filler, Plants, Educati","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o0vz7uoyL._AC_.jpg","description":"These water beads not only look nice, but they reduce the amount of water a plant needs to stay nourished! You will receive a bag of miniature beads. In order to grow into pearls, simply add water and let water beads sit until they are round smooth elegant pearls. Vase filler water beads are made of non-toxic super absorbent cross-linked polymer. Whether it's for your home living room or a wedding centerpiece, these water pearls look great anywhere you put them. Once the water beads are fully grown, these pearls last up to 4 months with continuous watering. Water pearls can also be shrunk back down and grown again at any time. Use these clear water beads as a vase filler and make them the table centerpiece for weddings. Every order includes a 1 Pound bag (1 lb.) of tiny soil beads. Simply submerge them in water and after a couple of hours, you will have unique elegant vase fillers in the form of large blue water pearls.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o0vz7uoyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Super Z Outlet","source_asin":"B01DQ415GE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-565913","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DQ415GE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DQ415GE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":565914,"name":"Coffee Mug Warmer Auto Shut Off, Up to 203 ℉ Hot Smart Timing Function 5-Gears Digital Display Touch Button 50W Electric Cup Warmer for Desk Tea Milk ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zhIbbioUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p>☕</p><p>【Up to 203℉/95℃】This coffee mug warmer offers 5 customized temperature settings from P1 to P5(122℉/50℃, 140℉/60℃, 158℉/70℃ 176℉/80℃ 203℉/95℃). It can heat up coffee or tea from room temperature to scalding hot up to 203℉/95℃ in 60s and keep at a comfortable hot temperature for drinking not too hot and not lukewarm as you like! No more just lukewarm or cold coffee! Get this if you're sick of microwave reheats and sipping cold coffee.</p> <p>☕</p> <p>【5 min Auto-off and 0-12 Hours Smart Timing Function】Valuable 5 minutes Auto off and 8 hours power off for standby safety features. This mug warmer adopts pressure-activated technology and designed with a gravity sensing switch- the cup warmer will auto off when the cup leaves for 5 minutes, and auto on immediately when put the cup on it again. Importantly, it shuts off automatically after 8 hours if forgotten and left on. No fire hazard and it didn't overheat and die. </p> <p>☕</p> <p>【Waterproof & Easy to Clean】This mug warmer for desk has a high hardness tempered glass panel that it is resistant to high temperature and anti cracking. It's also spill resistant and easy to clean with a cloth. The touch-sensitive buttons work well and you need to tap the button to adjust the settings. Digital display the gear you set and it's easy to read. It also has clean lines, looks modern and stylish.</p> <p>☕</p> <p>【Suitable for Most Mugs】The Coffee Mug Warmer is suitable for Metal, Earthenware, Ceramic, Enamel, Tile, High Temperature Plastic coffee cups, hand thrown mugs, glass teapot. Do not fit for Plastic/Paper/Empty/Vacuum cups. Mugs with flat or thin bottom perform best. Placing a lid over the mug will also help retain heat. Larger hot plate surface preheats any normal-sized mugs. </p> <p>☕</p> <p>【Simple use with a direct wall plug-in】You can use it beside your computer to keep your beverage warm/hot warm while reading, working or for your living room when watching TV or in meetings or while you sip in between mom-duties. Also can keep hot chocolate warm for a young child or even melt wax. It would be a wonderful Christmas/Birthday gift for someone who is a slow drinker or enjoys a hot cup of tea or whatever hot beverage they enjoy drinking. Make everyday a joy.</p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zhIbbioUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHEGIF","source_asin":"B09FKYZ71R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-565914","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FKYZ71R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FKYZ71R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
