window.products.push({"id":565942,"name":"Gneiss Spice | Complete Hanging Spice Rack Bundle: Small and Large Magnetic Jars + Wall Plate (20x10 Inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IywvZeF9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Spices out of reach? With spices kept in sight, you'll use them more often, dishing up flavorful food. Hexagon-shape creates a fun honeycomb pattern and smooth bottom jars showcase spices. Strong magnets keep jars from sliding; you can keep them in a moving RV! Internal food-safe magnet cap creates a barrier between spices and magnets. Lids form an airtight lock, keeping spices fresh. Includes clear waterproof and dishwasher-safe spice labels. Labels can be placed on lids or glass bottoms. Small jars measure 2\" tall x 1.75\" wide and hold a volume of a scant 1/4 cup. Large jars measure 2.5\" x 2.5\" and hold a heaping half cup. Ground spices should be used within 6-12 months. Purchase jars size accordingly to ensure freshness. Gneiss Spice recommends using a combination of jar sizes. Shop at a local bulk store and buy only the amount of spice you need; ditch those plastic disposable spice jars!  Gneiss Spice offers size-appropriate organic spice refills; seasonings are packed in compostable packaging for zero waste. Jars are empty to fill with spices from your pantry. On our website, our specialty is creating customized kits from our collection of 200+ seasonings. Fresh spices will improve the taste of your food! This bundle includes a large 20\" x 10\" stainless finish wall plate that can fit up to 24 small and 12 large spice jars. Use plate to store jars on a door, wall, side of cupboard or inside a cabinet. If you plan on hanging jars on your fridge, please purchase without the plate bundle.  Women-owned and operated, Gneiss Spice products are made in Maine from materials sourced in the USA and abroad. Buy worry-free with our lifetime defect warranty and friendly customer service. Contact us with questions or to build your own set of spices personalized to your pantry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IywvZeF9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gneiss Spice","source_asin":"B0B3GC9CR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-565942","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3GC9CR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3GC9CR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
