window.products.push({"id":565957,"name":"Essential Oil Diffuser & Top 10 Essential Oils Set, 300ml Aromatherapy Diffuser with 2 Mist Levels, 7 Ambient Light Settings, Ultrasonic Diffusers for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713HLOiCSNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our aromatherapy diffuser set with natural essential oils brings you a new fragrance experience. 1. 300 ml ultrasonic aroma diffuser 2. Quiet Performance(23dB) 3. Waterless auto shutoff Power 4. 2 Mist Modes 5. 10 packs of 5 ml essential oils(Grapefruit, Lavender, Eucalyptus, Tea Tree, Lemon, Sweet Orange, Bergamot, Peppermint, Cinnamon, Lemongrass) 6. 100 Pure & Nature Essential Oils 7. Max. 8 Hrs work time 8. BPAfree How to Use 1.Please add water to the tank first, then add essential oils up to the marking on the tube or until dispensing starts. If there's no fragrance, the wateroil balance may be off. Please add enough essential oil as instructed then. 2.It is recommended to use purified or distilled water. 3.Cinamon essential oil has higher density and viscosity than that of water. When adding the cinamon essential oil to the water, it will sink to the bottom. It is recommended that the essential oil be added directly on the water surface to accelerate diffusion. Technical Specifications: Voltage: DC24V Power: Ultrasonic Frequency: 2.4MHz Material: ABS+PP+PC Capacity: 300ml Working Time: >5h (High Mist), >8h (Low Mist) High Mist Output: 60ml/h Low Mist Output: 30ml/h Noise Level: Size: 6.3 x 5.9in / 16 x 15.1cm What' s in the Box: 1 x Aroma Diffuser with Set of 10 Essential Oils 1 x Power Adapter 1 x Cleaning Brush 1 x Essential Oil Tube 1 x User Guide ''","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713HLOiCSNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aromandina","source_asin":"B09MLPX1SG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-565957","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MLPX1SG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MLPX1SG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":565958,"name":"Misting Fan Portable, Camping Fan Rechargeable with Light & 250ml Water Tank, 10000mAh 8 Inch Battery Operated Fan with Hanging Hook, Beach Fan Outdoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LMJUOAFUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🐳【Upgraded Misting Version】Our misting desk fan is equipped with a 250ml water tank with 2 adjustable spray settings: when the water tank is full, the intermittent mode (last for 4h) and continuous mode (last for 2h). When the water fan runs out, you can refill via the hole on top, keeping you cool and moist all day long! 🔋【10000mAh Capacity Rechargeable Battery】Ausic misting fan portable with built-in a 10000mAh rechargeable battery, which can work continuously for 8-36 hours, bringing you more lasting coolness. 🌀【Powerful but Quiet Wind】Equipped with tri-blades, this cooling personal fan can deliver much stronger yet quiet airflow. 3 adjustable speeds will meet your demands for different occasions. Outdoor cooling fan to cool you down immediately on scorching days. ⛺【Super Bright LED light】2 kinds of brightness settings, our camping fan provides the ideal light source for outdoor activities at night, such as barbecues, picnics, hiking, fishing, etc. 🌴【330°Adjustable Angle & Hook Design】The portable battery operated fan supports 330° rotation adjustment, allowing you to get airflow from different directions. And with built-in foldable hooks, our outside fan can be better hung on tents, cars, branches, walls, outdoors, and simply on a table at home or office. 🌈【Sturdy & Great Gift】3 in 1 portable misting fan is made of sturdy and durable ABS material, which can prevent violent impact, so you can confidently use it on various occasions. In addition, it is also a great gift with a fine package for your friend and family. 😃【Warm Tips】1. If you hang the fan, please turn the fan over to keep the water tank up to keep the spray function working. 2. Cover the spray cap if not in use misting function. 3. Our products have a strict comprehensive quality inspection before selling. In order to test misting function, some water will remain in the water tank normally.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LMJUOAFUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ausic","source_asin":"B0C2L1MPPX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-565958","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2L1MPPX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2L1MPPX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
